// ============================================================
//  ICE Group — Gallery Data
//  Add new tiles by adding entries to the GALLERY array below.
//  This is the ONLY place you need to edit to add, remove, or
//  resize tiles on the Gallery page — no HTML editing needed.
//
//  Fields:
//    file:     filename in images/Gallery/  e.g. "drop-impact.jpg"
//              Leave "" to show a placeholder tile (icon + caption)
//              until a real image is added. If "youtube" (below) is set
//              and file is "", YouTube's own thumbnail is used instead.
//    caption:  Short description shown on hover
//    link:     Optional URL (paper / dataset), or "" for none. Ignored on
//              tiles that have a "youtube" video — the video takes over
//              the tile's click action instead.
//    youtube:  Optional YouTube video ID (e.g. "dQw4w9WgXcQ") — the tile
//              plays it in an in-page popup player when clicked. Add one
//              through the Site Editor: hover a Gallery tile and click 🎬. 
//    category: "surface" | "phenomena" | "process"  (used by the filter bar)
//    icon:     Emoji shown on placeholder tiles (only used when file is "") 💧 🩸 🫧 ❄️ 🧪 🧴 🍾 🌍 🔬 🧬 🌡 ⚡ 🕯 🌊 🧫 🧩
//    size:     "small" | "medium" | "large"  — see GALLERY_SIZES below
//
//  To add a tile:
//    1. Put the image file in the images/Gallery/ folder (optional —
//       tiles without an image show a placeholder instead)
//    2. Add an entry to the GALLERY array
//    3. Push to GitHub — done.
//
//  To remove a tile: delete its entry from the array.
//  To resize a tile: change its "size" field to "small", "medium", or "large".
// ============================================================

